  "releaseNotes": "- [Sg] Heap: structural-version floor attributed and compressed (131 -> ~105us per add+remove at n=20k; dense churn r=2000: ~70 -> ~60ms): updater consumes true set deltas (GetReader/GetChanges) instead of snapshot+computeDelta; constant uniform/singleton sources stage once without RegionWriter subscriptions; single-pass RO classification with cached sampler/size/feature lookups; hand-rolled comparers for geometry-dedup and mode-key interning replace generic structural hashing. Remainder is attributed (classification 16us, slot ops 15us, two sub-range uploads 12us, two resource-reader updates 15us, transact marking 29us) — further compression is backend surgery, documented.",
